  <metadata>
    <name>LASD26 official course (No Shortcuts directions)</name>
    <desc>Santa Monica Pier to Pacific Beach from the organizer's Google My Maps (232 elevation segments joined in order). Run length 115.3 mi; this line is 132.8 mi because the drive through Camp Pendleton (San Mateo Point to the Oceanside Chevron, 17.5 mi straight) is in it as a straight jump so the tracker's route index stays continuous. Elevation is the segments' smoothed start/end figures, interpolated.</desc>
    <time>2026-10-16T22:38:55.908Z</time>
  </metadata>
  <wpt lat="34.009970" lon="-118.496600"><name>START: Santa Monica Pier</name><desc>mile 0</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="33.394920" lon="-117.594100"><name>Into the van (San Mateo Point)</name><desc>run mile 81.1 — everyone drives I-5 through Camp Pendleton</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="33.209310" lon="-117.387500"><name>Runner restarts (Oceanside Chevron)</name><desc>run mile 81.1 · GPX mile 98.7</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="32.800819" lon="-117.235865"><name>FINISH: Milestone Running Shop PB</name><desc>run mile 115.3 · GPX mile 132.8</desc></wpt>
